# @hub-lanes

# ── SECRET ENVELOPE SWEEP LANE (BH-7965, BH-7937.2) ──────────────────────────
# Every hour at :23. One POST /api/secrets/envelope/sweep: the jobs worker
# deletes expired envelopes nobody read and archives, then deletes, envelope
# events older than settings row secret_envelope_events_retention_days. Counts
# only while SECRET_ENVELOPE_SWEEP_DRY_RUN is 1 (the default).
# Off: flags/lane-off-secret-envelope-sweep (bin/harness-ctl.sh off secret-envelope-sweep).
23 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/secret-envelope-sweep.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
